@startuml

title SCOMP Sprint 3 - Diagrama de Componentes
left to right direction
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam packageStyle rectangle

actor "Flight Control\nOperator" as Operator

package "Processo principal - flight_simulator" {
    component "Simulation Controller\nmain.c" as Main
    component "Position Tracker\nposition_tracker.c" as Tracker
    component "Safety Thread\nsafety_detection_thread()" as SafetyThread
    component "Report Thread\nreport_generation_thread()" as ReportThread
    component "Safety Monitor\nsafety_monitor.c" as Safety
}

package "Processos filho - um por voo" {
    component "Flight Process [1..N]\nflight_process.c" as FlightProcess
    component "Flight Plan Parser\nflight_plan_parser.c" as Parser
}

package "IPC e sincronizacao POSIX" {
    queue "Update Pipe [1..N]\nPositionUpdate" as UpdatePipe
    database "POSIX Shared Memory\nSharedSimulationState\nSharedFlightState [1..N]" as Shared
    component "Semaforos process-shared\nmutex, update_sem,\nstep_start[1..N]" as Semaphores
    component "pthread process-shared\npthread_mutex + pthread_cond" as SharedCond
    component "pthread local\nstep_mutex/step_cond\nreport_mutex/violation_cond" as LocalSync
}

database "Planos de voo\nJSON" as Json
file "Relatorio final\n<output>.txt" as FinalReport
file "Log em tempo real\n<output>_violations.log" as LiveReport

Operator --> Main : argumentos CLI
Main --> FlightProcess : fork()
Main --> FlightProcess : SIGUSR2 / SIGTERM
Safety --> FlightProcess : SIGUSR1

FlightProcess --> Parser : parse_flight_plan()
Parser --> Json : le

FlightProcess --> UpdatePipe : write(PositionUpdate)
UpdatePipe --> Main : poll() + read()
Main --> Tracker : tracker_update()

Main --> Shared : shm_open() + mmap()
FlightProcess --> Shared : shm_open() + mmap()\natualiza SharedFlightState
Shared *-- Semaphores
Shared *-- SharedCond
Main --> Semaphores : sem_post(step_start[i])\nliberta timestep
FlightProcess --> Semaphores : sem_wait(step_start[i])\nsem_wait/post(mutex)\nsem_post(update_sem)
FlightProcess --> SharedCond : incrementa contador\npthread_cond_signal()

Main --> LocalSync : steps_ready++\nstep_cond signal/wait
LocalSync --> SafetyThread : acorda por timestep
SafetyThread --> Safety : safety_check_shared()
Safety --> Semaphores : sem_wait/post(mutex)
Safety --> Shared : copia snapshot dos voos
SafetyThread --> LocalSync : steps_checked + ACK\nviolation_cond signal
LocalSync --> ReportThread : acorda com novos eventos

Main --> FinalReport : write_report()
ReportThread --> LiveReport : safety_log_event_realtime()

note bottom of LiveReport
Se --output terminar em .txt, o sufixo e substituido por
_violations.log; caso contrario usa simulation_violations.log.
end note

@enduml
